{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Splash Zone</strong> is a first-person shooter, but instead of blood and bullets, it\u2019s all about ducks with water guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll run around different arenas, blasting other players with water while trying out all kinds of game modes \u2014 like capture the flag, free-for-all, and even hide and seek. Whether you\u2019re playing with friends or jumping into a quick match, it\u2019s just meant to be fun, fast, and a little bit chaotic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No blood. No serious competition. Just ducks, water, and a whole lot of splashing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887750?t=1753114906","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887750?t=1753114906","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887750/49109b35bb42590e0fafae325c10fdcb5f17a413/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753114906","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887750/49109b35bb42590e0fafae325c10fdcb5f17a413/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753114906","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Splash Zone</strong> is a first-person shooter, but instead of blood and bullets, it\u2019s all about ducks with water guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll run around different arenas, blasting other players with water while trying out all kinds of game modes \u2014 like capture the flag, free-for-all, and even hide and seek. Whether you\u2019re playing with friends or jumping into a quick match, it\u2019s just meant to be fun, fast, and a little bit chaotic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No bloo